("redress","OLD FRENCH ORIGIN",[("re-","again","再次","a circular arrow"),("drecier","to straighten (Latin directus)","弄直","a bent ruler being straightened")],("straighten again → set right a wrong","糾正；補救（錯誤或不公）"),"a fair referee replays the video and gives back the goal that was wrongly taken away; the team cheers.","Straighten out what went wrong,","Redress the wrong and right the song."),
